[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1274.19, "timestamp": "00:21:14", "text": "然後我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1279.029, "timestamp": "00:21:19", "text": "好吧，我必須決定我該做什麼，我該怎麼處理所有的事情，諸如此類"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1286.549, "timestamp": "00:21:26", "text": "。我當時一直在胡思亂想，想著我該做什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1311.99, "timestamp": "00:21:51", "text": "等等，然後就到了凌晨五、六點，我都沒睡。  昨天我覺得內心一片空白，很迷茫，各種情緒交織在一起。我當時想，「我的天哪，我們週日要直播，但我現在還沒準備"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1314.699, "timestamp": "00:21:54", "author": "@ArusuAraeru", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dc2GWSBeOIoWoV_Yu1KJZ8Rd0EIvVX2NE8TZKOPigrbOXUH6MSPklyA0oUxTSJrKKkxsV3rdQA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "today? hmm... If bread kun is up for it"}]